{
  "key": 11187,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_StrengthsAndWeaknesses",
      "en_US": [
        "You know how Pokémon have types like\n",
        "Water, Fire, and Grass?\r",
        "Well, all types have strengths and\n",
        "weaknesses against other types."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_ChatAndTradeInUnionRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "In the Union Room upstairs, you can\n",
        "chat and trade with other people.\r",
        "And that’s not all you can do.\n",
        "Check it out!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_CanStillCatchWithSixPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "You can still catch a Pokémon if you\n",
        "already have six traveling with you.\r",
        "It automatically gets sent to the PC\n",
        "network in Pokémon Centers.\r",
        "Knowing that, I can keep on catching\n",
        "more and more Pokémon!\r",
        "It’ll make it more fun to check\n",
        "the PC in any Pokémon Center!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_KinseyIntro_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi, can we feature you in a news piece\n",
        "we’re doing?\r",
        "All you have to do is battle with me.\n",
        "Will you do that?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_KinseyBattleAccepted_Unused",
      "en_US": "Reporter Kinsey’s live interview!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_KinseyBattleDeclined_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Unbelievable! Press coverage denied!\n",
        "I find you intriguing, too..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_KinseyPostBattle_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "To get people to open up, we approach\n",
        "them honestly with no hidden tricks.\r",
        "It’s like the relationship between\n",
        "Pokémon and Trainers, isn’t it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_TevinIntro_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ve spotted a charismatic Trainer!\n",
        "Is it OK to go for the scoop?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_TevinBattleAccepted_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "As a professional cameraman, I always\n",
        "go for the best shot!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_TevinBattleDeclined_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s a downer...\r",
        "I thought I’d found a Trainer and\n",
        "Pokémon who’d shine on camera."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_TevinPostBattle_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "The lively expressions on you and your\n",
        "Pokémon’s faces...\r",
        "It sure makes for some great TV!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_LeeIntro_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Are we all ready to have some fun?\n",
        "I sure am! Aren’t you having fun?!\f",
        "Let’s make it fun! OK?!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_LeeBattleAccepted_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, how shall we do this?\n",
        "Shall we do something fantastical?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_LeeBattleDeclined_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, how shall I say this...?\n",
        "It makes me all lonely, I say..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_LeePostBattle_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "A clown’s makeup is a face that’s\n",
        "crying while laughing. Mwahahah!\r",
        "It defines what we do!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! You’re a Trainer!\n",
        "You’re just who we need!\r",
        "Ah, excuse me. I’m with Jubilife TV.\r",
        "We’re the Fun-and-Games TV station,\n",
        "operating straight from this city!\r",
        "We’re running a little promotion\n",
        "right now in south west Sinnoh.\r",
        "Just answer five questions correctly,\n",
        "and you can receive a fantastic prize!\r",
        "Do you want to have a go?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerDeclined",
      "en_US": [
        "No, really? You really should!\n",
        "Trust me, the prize is G-R-E-A-T!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerRollCamera",
      "en_US": [
        "Alright! Brilliant!\n",
        "Let’s get these cameras rolling!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerWrong",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m sorry, but that’s not correct...\n",
        "But you’re welcome to try again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerWon",
      "en_US": [
        "You’ve won the grand prize!\n",
        "Stupendous work, young Trainer.\r",
        "The grand prize of this quiz is the\n",
        "three Pokémon I just battled you with!\r",
        "The Pokémon for Trainers in Kanto.\n",
        "Bulbasaur, Charmander and Squirtle!\r",
        "Talk to me when you’re ready to\n",
        "receive your fabulous prize!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerPrizeIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "To the winner go the spoils!\n",
        "Here you go!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerBye",
      "en_US": [
        "Thanks a bunch for playing!\r",
        "Keep an eye out for our colleagues\n",
        "in Oreburgh and Floaroma.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerCameraman",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, Trainer! Don’t mind me.\n",
        "I’m just a friendly cameraman."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerLetsFind",
      "en_US": "We’ll see if your answer is correct!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName1",
      "en_US": [
        "First up, the Seed Pokémon.\n",
        "It’s BULBASAUR!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived1",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a BULBASAUR!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname1",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this BULBASAUR?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName2",
      "en_US": [
        "Next, we have the Lizard Pokémon.\n",
        "It’s CHARMANDER!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived2",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a CHARMANDER!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname2",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this CHARMANDER?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName3",
      "en_US": [
        "Last, we have the Tiny Turtle Pokémon.\n",
        "It’s SQUIRTLE!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived3",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a SQUIRTLE!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname3",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this SQUIRTLE?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNoRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, sorry.\r",
        "You haven’t got room in your team\n",
        "for these three fabulous Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion1",
      "en_US": [
        "Here we go!\n",
        "It’s the first question!\r",
        "Is Pikachu an Electric-type Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion2",
      "en_US": [
        "That is correct!\n",
        "How about this second question?\r",
        "Does the Kanto region’s Saffron City\n",
        "have an active Fighting-type Gym?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion3",
      "en_US": [
        "Keep it going!\n",
        "Question number three!\r",
        "Professor Oak is a well-known Pokémon\n",
        "researcher based in the Kanto region.\r",
        "Is his full name Samson Oak?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion4",
      "en_US": [
        "Right you are!\n",
        "The semifinal question!\r",
        "On the Sevii Islands, is it true that\n",
        "the Trainer Tower is on Seven Island?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "JubilifeCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion5",
      "en_US": [
        "Excellent! Fantastic!\n",
        "The last question!\r",
        "Do you think you can beat me\n",
        "in a Pokémon battle?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
